Z||000009||stsmithgt||11-29-2000||06:52 PM||||It's sad that people try to make such a rivalry(sp) between one car over another.  I can spend hours looking at all kinds of cars not taking in mind of who made them, but what the owner has done to them now.  Speaking of which, the Autorama is coming up in Febuary at Cal Expo in Sacramento.  I spend all day there.  Sometimes two days.  I can appreciate automotive engineering and the individual imagination that's put in to those cars. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
